{
  "title": "Nutty Spicy Jamaican Semolina Pilaf",
  "description": "A spicy and fluffy meal prep dish featuring semolina with an al dente finish, this Jamaican pilaf is perfect for a weeknight dinner, served from a lazy Susan spinner for easy access.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
